# Algorithmic Trading and Market Liquidity: A Comprehensive Analysis of High-Frequency Trading Strategies

**Authors:** Dr. Bhadrappa Haralayya, Sharanbasappa Shetkar

## Abstract
This study provided a thorough analysis of high-frequency trading (HFT) strategies and their implications for market liquidity. Through the help of this research, an individual explores the different types and characteristics of HFT strategies. In that case, different influencing strategies are also discussed in this study. Challenges associated with HFT also be discussed which are mitigated through the help of effective strategies. In this study, the primary method was used where 70 trading experts offered their valuable experiences.

